attribution does not evaluate whether external testimonies, internal correspondences, and transmission patterns could cumulatively contribute identity-specific likelihood. Live burden: Licona must demonstrate that each consideration discriminates Matthew or John from alternatives and that their combination supplies a grounded connection, rather than converting general reliability or compositional possibility into personal attribution. Locked score: The very-strong 94 recognizes near-complete burden contact, extraordinary responsiveness, disciplined calibration, representational charity, and coherent diagnosis, while retaining evidentiary caution."}]}
